# Web Application Production Upgrade Plan

This plan outlines the steps required to wire up the remaining partially implemented frontend features to their fully functioning backend APIs, preparing the "Ink & Brass" root web app for a production-ready hackathon demo. We will prioritize chat history and resume/avatar uploads as requested.

## User Review Required

> [!WARNING]
> **Google OAuth Approach**: I will integrate `passport-google-oauth20` with the existing JWT-based `auth.js` routes as you suggested. This allows avoiding a full rewrite with NextAuth at the last minute and maintains a single JWT authentication system.
> 
> **Stories Schema**: The `SuccessStory` schema currently lacks fields for upvotes/celebrates. I will add an `upvoteCount Int @default(0)` field to `schema.prisma` and run a migration to support real voting in `StoriesContent.tsx`. 

